  "sdo:name": "82 Surfstainable Community - Slide Water Sports for Science in Action Programme",
  "sdo:description": "Surfstainable will promote the participation of people involved in slide waters sports to become ambassadors for the protection of the sea by means of scientific activities in collaboration with experts addressing data collection in marine ecosystems and its threats.  This water sport in action initiative would like to involve sporting organizations in terms of clubs and federations, leagues in charge of competitions, together with universities, NGOs and tech enterprise to promote the understanding of the ocean system, supporting the data collection, rethinking the relations between sea and people and promoting eco-friendly technologies in the branch of the leisure business.",
